---
description: |
  System rules for this repository:
  - Project: Next.js (pages router) + TypeScript + Tailwind.
  - Non-breaking refactors only; prefer least-diff solutions.
  - Do not modify external behavior or public API unless guarded by a reversible shim.
  - All answers must be: (1) a unified diff for the single provided file;
    (2) a terse changelog; (3) a backout plan; (4) a risk checklist with Y/N.
  - Never introduce new files, dependencies, or cross-file imports unless explicitly authorized.
  - If uncertainty exists, choose the smallest no-risk change or leave a TODO comment.
globs:
  - "**/*.ts"
  - "**/*.tsx"
alwaysApply: true
---
